Z||000015||BAM-BAM||04-03-2001||11:20 PM|||| Thanks for the inputs peeps. YOKO A520's it will most likely be.<P> RogerG- I agree with you completely and if I had just a tad more money I could get some that show no lug holes at all, like the Hokenkeim or Revo by TSW. <P> IFST- That is the display wheel only. They are made for either application and multidrilling makes it less expensive and easier to sell.<P> Stimp-Da-Pimp- You got me on that one bro, it is VTec. I know I can and probably will aim higher, but those little ba$tards are always mess'n wit me yo! As for the install, I will do it myself. It will take longer than I would like, but if I rely on someone else to do it I won't learn anything. This way, I will have trials and tribulations to hand down to you all.<P> K-R 31 and Formula 88, thanks for the nice words.<BR>  <BR>  Be good everyone, I have to get back to my plans and schemes. <P>P.S. Don't let on, but mi esposa is actualy encouraging me! (I wonder what she want's?)  <P>Peace, B2 OUT!     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!<P>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 04-03-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 04-03-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 04-03-2001).]||||reg||12
